      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thanks for your report. The \"Allow Self\" and \"Allow Others\" options are intended to be specific to avatars only. This is reflected in the physbone inspector when configuring collisions, where those options disappear if you deselect Avatar as an accepted source of collisions.\n\nThere is indeed an inconsistency there with contact receivers - they'll likely be updated to:\n\n- Hide those options when Avatar is not selected.\n\n- Only use those options when processing an avatar-to-avatar contact. Avatar-to-world and world-to-world contact events will ignore them.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
